#: ../../explanation/security.md:1
msgid "安全子系统详解"
msgstr "Security Subsystem Details"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:3
msgid ""
"本文详细解释 SparkLink SLE 安全子系统的设计与实现, 涵盖配对鉴权、密钥派生、帧加密、隐私保护和 UWB 测量安全, 对标 "
"TXS-10002-2025 标准第 9 章。"
msgstr "This document explains the design and implementation of the SparkLink SLE security subsystem, covering pairing authentication, key derivation, frame encryption, privacy protection, and UWB measurement security, cross-referenced against Chapter 9 of TXS-10002-2025."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:5
msgid "安全架构"
msgstr "Security Architecture"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:7
msgid "SLE 安全子系统分为三层:"
msgstr "The SLE security subsystem is organized in three layers:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:9
msgid "**配对鉴权层**: 建立信任关系, 交换密钥材料 (§9.2)"
msgstr "**Pairing authentication layer**: establish trust relationships, exchange key material (§9.2)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:10
msgid "**帧加密层**: 保护数据传输的机密性和完整性 (§9.3)"
msgstr "**Frame encryption layer**: protect data transmission confidentiality and integrity (§9.3)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:11
msgid "**隐私保护层**: 防止设备追踪 (§9.4)"
msgstr "**Privacy protection layer**: prevent device tracking (§9.4)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:13
msgid "安全的基础是 ECDH P-256 密钥协商, 派生出所有后续密钥。"
msgstr "Security is built on ECDH P-256 key agreement, from which all subsequent keys are derived."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:15
msgid "配对流程 (§9.2)"
msgstr "Pairing Procedure (§9.2)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:17
msgid "配对是两个设备首次建立安全关联的过程。标准定义了 6 种鉴权方法:"
msgstr "Pairing is the process by which two devices first establish a security association. The standard defines 6 authentication methods:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "方法"
msgstr "Method"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Applicable Scenario"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "数值比较"
msgstr "Numeric comparison"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "双方有显示和输入能力"
msgstr "Both parties have display and input capability"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "密码输入"
msgstr "Passkey entry"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "一方有输入能力"
msgstr "One party has input capability"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "密码校验"
msgstr "Passkey verification"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "预共享密码"
msgstr "Pre-shared passkey"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "带外传输"
msgstr "Out-of-band transfer"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "NFC 等侧信道"
msgstr "NFC and other side channels"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "预共享密钥"
msgstr "Pre-shared key"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "工厂预置密钥"
msgstr "Factory-provisioned key"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "无输入"
msgstr "No input"

#: ../../explanation/security.md
msgid "无交互能力 (Just Works)"
msgstr "No interaction capability (Just Works)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:28
msgid "鉴权方法的选择由双方 IO 能力 (无输入无输出、仅显示、仅键盘、显示+键盘、显示+是否) 协商决定。"
msgstr "The authentication method is determined by negotiating the IO capabilities of both parties (no input/no output, display only, keyboard only, display+keyboard, display+yes/no)."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:30
msgid "配对状态机"
msgstr "Pairing State Machine"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:32
msgid "配对流程由 9 个状态组成:"
msgstr "The pairing procedure consists of 9 states:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:49
msgid "G 节点视角:"
msgstr "G node perspective:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:51
msgid "**IDLE → REQUEST_SENT**: 发送 `PairingRequest`, 携带 IO 能力、密钥长度、安全分发信息、加密能力"
msgstr "**IDLE → REQUEST_SENT**: send `PairingRequest`, carrying IO capabilities, key length, security distribution info, encryption capability"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:52
msgid ""
"**REQUEST_SENT → CONFIRM_SENT**: 收到 `PairingResponse`, 发送 "
"`PairingConfirm` (含 G 节点 P-256 公钥 X/Y 坐标, 各 32 字节)"
msgstr "**REQUEST_SENT → CONFIRM_SENT**: received `PairingResponse`, sends `PairingConfirm` (containing G-node P-256 public key X/Y coordinates, 32 bytes each)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:53
msgid ""
"**CONFIRM_SENT → PUBLIC_KEY_EXCHANGED**: 收到 `PairingInitialInfo` (T "
"节点公钥), 计算 ECDH 共享密钥, 发送 Ra 随机数"
msgstr "**CONFIRM_SENT → PUBLIC_KEY_EXCHANGED**: received `PairingInitialInfo` (T-node public key), computes ECDH shared secret, sends Ra nonce"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:54
msgid "**PUBLIC_KEY_EXCHANGED → CONFIRM_CODE_SENT**: 收到 Rb, 发送 `GNodeConfirmCode`"
msgstr "**PUBLIC_KEY_EXCHANGED → CONFIRM_CODE_SENT**: received Rb, send `GNodeConfirmCode`"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:55
msgid "**CONFIRM_CODE_SENT → COMPLETED**: 收到 `TNodeConfirmCode`, 验证确认码, 派生密钥"
msgstr "**CONFIRM_CODE_SENT → COMPLETED**: received `TNodeConfirmCode`, verify confirmation code, derive keys"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:57
msgid "T 节点视角是上述流程的镜像:"
msgstr "T node perspective is the mirror of the above procedure:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:59
msgid "**IDLE → INITIATED**: 收到 `PairingInitiate`"
msgstr "**IDLE → INITIATED**: received `PairingInitiate`"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:60
msgid "**INITIATED → RESPONSE_SENT**: 收到 `PairingRequest`, 发送 `PairingResponse`"
msgstr "**INITIATED → RESPONSE_SENT**: received `PairingRequest`, send `PairingResponse`"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:61
msgid ""
"**RESPONSE_SENT → PUBLIC_KEY_EXCHANGED**: 收到 `PairingConfirm`, 保存 G 公钥, "
"发送自身公钥"
msgstr "**RESPONSE_SENT → PUBLIC_KEY_EXCHANGED**: received `PairingConfirm`, saves G-node public key, sends its own public key"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:62
msgid "**PUBLIC_KEY_EXCHANGED → CONFIRM_CODE_SENT**: 收到 Ra, 计算 DH Key, 发送 Rb"
msgstr "**PUBLIC_KEY_EXCHANGED → CONFIRM_CODE_SENT**: received Ra, compute DH Key, send Rb"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:63
msgid ""
"**CONFIRM_CODE_SENT → COMPLETED**: 收到 `GNodeConfirmCode`, 验证后发送 "
"`TNodeConfirmCode`, 派生密钥"
msgstr "**CONFIRM_CODE_SENT → COMPLETED**: received `GNodeConfirmCode`, verifies and sends `TNodeConfirmCode`, derives session keys"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:65
msgid "失败处理"
msgstr "Failure Handling"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:67
msgid "12 种失败原因:"
msgstr "12 failure reasons:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "代码"
msgstr "Code"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
