msgid "命令不支持"
msgstr "Command not supported"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "0x08"
msgstr "0x08"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "未指定原因"
msgstr "Unspecified reason"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "0x09"
msgstr "0x09"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "重复尝试"
msgstr "Repeated attempts"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "0x0A"
msgstr "0x0A"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "参数无效"
msgstr "Invalid parameter"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "0x0B"
msgstr "0x0B"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "DH Key 校验失败"
msgstr "DH Key check failed"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "0x0C"
msgstr "0x0C"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:34
msgid "数值比较失败"
msgstr "Numeric comparison failed"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:84
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.security_manager.PairingManager` 实现状态机, `mac.security` "
"模块定义 20 种配对信令消息类, `mac.security_manager.ECDHKeyPair` 封装 P-256 椭圆曲线运算。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: `mac.security_manager.PairingManager` implements the state machine; `mac.security` defines 20 pairing signaling message classes; `mac.security_manager.ECDHKeyPair` encapsulates P-256 elliptic curve operations."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:86
msgid "密钥派生 (§9.3)"
msgstr "Key Derivation (§9.3)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:88
msgid "配对完成后, 通过 ECDH 共享密钥逐级派生出各功能密钥:"
msgstr "After pairing is complete, functional keys are derived step by step from the ECDH shared secret:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:101
msgid "KDF 算法"
msgstr "KDF Algorithm"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:103
msgid "标准支持两种 KDF:"
msgstr "The standard supports two KDFs:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:105
msgid "**AES-CMAC**: 128 位密钥, 输出 128 位 MAC (§9.3.4)"
msgstr "**AES-CMAC**: 128-bit key, 128-bit MAC output (§9.3.4)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:106
msgid "**HMAC-SM3**: 256 位摘要取低 128 位 (§9.3.4)"
msgstr "**HMAC-SM3**: 256-bit digest, lower 128 bits used (§9.3.4)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:108
msgid "双方在配对阶段协商使用哪种 KDF。"
msgstr "Both parties negotiate which KDF to use during the pairing phase."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:110
msgid "确认码生成 (§9.3.4.3)"
msgstr "Confirmation Code Generation (§9.3.4.3)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:112
msgid "确认码保证远端设备确实持有 DH Key。生成方式取决于鉴权方法:"
msgstr "The confirmation code ensures the remote device actually holds the DH Key. Generation depends on the authentication method:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:114
msgid "**数值比较**: KDF(PKax, PKax ‖ PKbx ‖ Ra ‖ 0)"
msgstr "**Numeric comparison**: KDF(PKax, PKax ‖ PKbx ‖ Ra ‖ 0)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:115
msgid "**密码输入**: KDF(PKax, PKax ‖ PKbx ‖ Ra ‖ Ri)"
msgstr "**Passkey entry**: KDF(PKax, PKax ‖ PKbx ‖ Ra ‖ Ri)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:116
msgid "**密码校验**: KDF(PKax, PKax ‖ PKbx ‖ Ra ‖ Pwd)"
msgstr "**Passkey verification**: KDF(PKax, PKax ‖ PKbx ‖ Ra ‖ Pwd)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:117
msgid "**带外/预共享/Just Works**: 类似数值比较"
msgstr "**Out-of-band/Pre-shared/Just Works**: similar to numeric comparison"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:119
msgid "数值比较码 (§9.3.4.6)"
msgstr "Numeric Comparison Code (§9.3.4.6)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:121
msgid "从 KDF 输出取 4 字节, 对 $10^6$ 取模, 得到 6 位十进制数字, 双方显示给用户比对。"
msgstr "Take 4 bytes from KDF output, modulo $10^6$, to get a 6-digit decimal number displayed to users on both sides for comparison."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:123
msgid "**代码实现**: `mac.crypto` 模块实现全部密钥派生函数:"
msgstr "**Code implementation**: the `mac.crypto` module implements all key derivation functions:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:125
msgid "`aes_cmac()`, `hmac_sm3()`, `kdf()`"
msgstr "`aes_cmac()`, `hmac_sm3()`, `kdf()`"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:126
msgid "`derive_link_key()`, `derive_session_key()`, `derive_dh_verify_key()`"
msgstr "`derive_link_key()`, `derive_session_key()`, `derive_dh_verify_key()`"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:127
msgid ""
"`generate_confirm_code()`, `generate_dh_verify_code()`, "
"`generate_numeric_code()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../explanation/security.md:128
msgid "`obfuscate()` 混淆算法 (§9.3.4.7)"
msgstr "`obfuscate()` obfuscation algorithm (§9.3.4.7)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:129
msgid "`secure_random_256()` 安全随机函数 (§6.10.7)"
msgstr "`secure_random_256()` secure random function (§6.10.7)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:131
msgid "帧加密 (§9.3.1)"
msgstr "Frame Encryption (§9.3.1)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:133
msgid "AES-CCM"
msgstr "AES-CCM"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:135
msgid "SLE 使用 AES-CCM (Counter with CBC-MAC) 进行帧加密, 同时保证机密性和完整性:"
msgstr "SLE uses AES-CCM (Counter with CBC-MAC) for frame encryption, simultaneously ensuring confidentiality and integrity:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:137
msgid "**机密性**: AES-CTR 模式加密载荷"
msgstr "**Confidentiality**: AES-CTR mode encrypts payload"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:138
msgid "**完整性**: CBC-MAC 生成 MIC (消息完整性校验码), 长度 4/8/12/16 字节"
msgstr "**Integrity**: CBC-MAC generates MIC (Message Integrity Code), 4/8/12/16 bytes in length"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:140
msgid "Nonce 构建"
msgstr "Nonce Construction"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:142
msgid "Nonce 是 AES-CCM 的关键输入, 保证每个帧使用不同的计数器:"
msgstr "The nonce is a critical input to AES-CCM, ensuring each frame uses a different counter:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:144
msgid "**异步/同步单播和组播链路**:"
msgstr "**Asynchronous/synchronous unicast and multicast links**:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:153
msgid "`payload_count`: 单调递增计数器 (39 位), 防止 nonce 重用"
msgstr "`payload_count`: monotonically increasing counter (39 bits), prevents nonce reuse"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:154
msgid "`Direction`: 0 = G→T, 1 = T→G"
msgstr "`Direction`: 0 = G→T, 1 = T→G"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:155
msgid "`IV`: 由 IV 基值和帧参数计算得出"
msgstr "`IV`: computed from the IV base value and frame parameters"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:157
msgid "**其他链路** (广播/SMF):"
msgstr "**Other links** (broadcast/SMF):"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:166
msgid "IV 计算 (§9.3.1)"
msgstr "IV Computation (§9.3.1)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:168
msgid "IV 基值 (8 字节) 与不同参数异或:"
msgstr "IV base value (8 bytes) XORed with different parameters:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:170
msgid "**FT1/FT2**: IV = IV_base $\\oplus$ 同步序列号"
msgstr "**FT1/FT2**: IV = IV_base $\\oplus$ sync sequence number"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:171
msgid "**FT3/FT4**: IV = IV_base $\\oplus$ 链路 ID"
msgstr "**FT3/FT4**: IV = IV_base $\\oplus$ link ID"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:173
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.security_manager.FrameCryptoContext` 管理加解密上下文, 维护 TX/RX "
"payload_count, 调用 `mac.crypto.aes_ccm_encrypt()`/`aes_ccm_decrypt()`。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: `mac.security_manager.FrameCryptoContext` manages the encryption/decryption context, maintains TX/RX payload_count, and calls `mac.crypto.aes_ccm_encrypt()`/`aes_ccm_decrypt()`."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:175
msgid "组播安全 (§9.3.2)"
msgstr "Multicast Security (§9.3.2)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:177
msgid "组播链路使用独立的密钥体系:"
msgstr "Multicast links use a separate key hierarchy:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:188
msgid "分发流程:"
msgstr "Distribution procedure:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:190
msgid "G 节点生成 RAND 和 KDF/加密/完整性算法参数, 通过 `MulticastAlgorithmConfig` 发送"
msgstr "G node generates RAND and KDF/encryption/integrity algorithm parameters, sent via `MulticastAlgorithmConfig`"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:191
msgid ""
"G 节点计算 $K_g$ = KDF(link_key, RAND), 发送 $C$ = $K_g \\oplus GK$ 通过 "
"`MulticastKeyConfig`"
msgstr "The G-node computes $K_g$ = KDF(link_key, RAND) and sends $C$ = $K_g \\oplus GK$ via `MulticastKeyConfig`"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:192
msgid "T 节点用自身 link_key 计算 $K_g$, 恢复 $GK$ = $C \\oplus K_g$"
msgstr "The T-node computes $K_g$ from its own link_key to recover $GK$ = $C \\oplus K_g$"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:194
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.crypto.generate_group_key()`, "
"`derive_group_session_key()`, `derive_kg()`; `mac.security` 模块定义 "
"`MulticastAlgorithmConfig` 和 `MulticastKeyConfig` 信令。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: `mac.crypto.generate_group_key()`, `derive_group_session_key()`, `derive_kg()`; the `mac.security` module defines `MulticastAlgorithmConfig` and `MulticastKeyConfig` signaling messages."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:196
msgid "隐私保护 (§9.4)"
msgstr "Privacy Protection (§9.4)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:198
msgid "SLE 支持可解析随机地址, 防止第三方追踪设备:"
msgstr "SLE supports resolvable random addresses to prevent third-party device tracking:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:200
msgid "设备生成 IRK (身份解析密钥, 16 字节), 在配对阶段通过 `GNodeIRK`/`TNodeIRK` 交换"
msgstr "Device generates IRK (Identity Resolving Key, 16 bytes), exchanged during pairing via `GNodeIRK`/`TNodeIRK`"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:201
msgid "设备使用 IRK 和随机数生成可解析地址 (48 位): 高 24 位为 hash(IRK, prand), 低 24 位为 prand"
msgstr "Device uses IRK and a random number to generate a resolvable address (48 bits): upper 24 bits are hash(IRK, prand), lower 24 bits are prand"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:202
msgid "已知 IRK 的设备可以验证和解析该地址, 未知 IRK 的设备无法关联不同地址"
msgstr "Devices knowing the IRK can verify and resolve the address; devices without the IRK cannot correlate different addresses"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:204
msgid ""
"地址分发通过 `GNodeAddress`/`TNodeAddress` 信令完成, 携带地址类型 (联盟分配、第三方本地、联盟预留、私有) 和 "
"6 字节地址。"
msgstr "Address distribution is accomplished through `GNodeAddress`/`TNodeAddress` signaling, carrying the address type (consortium-assigned, third-party local, consortium-reserved, private) and a 6-byte address."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:206
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.crypto.generate_resolvable_address(kdf_type, irk, "
"rand_part)` 和 `resolve_address(kdf_type, irk, addr)`。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: `mac.crypto.generate_resolvable_address(kdf_type, irk, rand_part)` and `resolve_address(kdf_type, irk, addr)`."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:208
msgid "UWB 测量安全 (§9.5)"
msgstr "UWB Measurement Security (§9.5)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:210
msgid "UWB 脉冲测量信号需要专用的安全机制, 防止距离欺骗攻击。"
msgstr "UWB pulse measurement signals require dedicated security mechanisms to prevent distance spoofing attacks."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:212
msgid "CTS 密钥体系"
msgstr "CTS Key System"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:214
msgid "从 Link Key 出发, 派生 UWB 测量专用密钥:"
msgstr "Starting from the Link Key, derive UWB measurement-specific keys:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:229
msgid "inputContext (§9.5, 表 71)"
msgstr "inputContext (§9.5, Table 71)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:231
msgid "128 位上下文参数, 编码测量会话的物理层配置:"
msgstr "128-bit context parameter encoding the physical layer configuration of the measurement session:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:233
msgid "物理信道号"
msgstr "Physical channel number"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:234
msgid "测距方法和模式"
msgstr "Ranging method and mode"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:235
msgid "NMSS 采样数"
msgstr "NMSS sample count"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:236
msgid "G 节点 L2 ID"
msgstr "G node L2 ID"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:237
msgid "天线配置"
msgstr "Antenna configuration"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:238
msgid "其他保留位"
msgstr "Other reserved bits"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:240
msgid "密钥更新"
msgstr "Key Update"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:242
msgid "每次测量会话结束后, `ctsContent32Bit` 递增, 重新派生三个密钥。这确保每次测量使用不同的加扰序列。"
msgstr "After each measurement session, `ctsContent32Bit` is incremented and three keys are re-derived. This ensures each measurement uses a different scrambling sequence."

#: ../../explanation/security.md:244
msgid "TGap 计算 (§9.5.4)"
msgstr "TGap Computation (§9.5.4)"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:246
msgid "TGap 控制 CTS 符号间的时间间隔, 从 `ctsGap` 的 128 位值中按偏移截取 10 位:"
msgstr "TGap controls the time interval between CTS symbols, extracting 10 bits at an offset from the 128-bit `ctsGap` value:"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:248
#, python-brace-format
msgid "T_{gap} = T_{base} - T_{offset}"
msgstr "T_{gap} = T_{base} - T_{offset}"

#: ../../explanation/security.md:250
#, python-brace-format
msgid "其中 $T_{offset}$ 由 ctsGap 对应位计算。"
msgstr "where $T_{offset}$ is computed from the corresponding bits of ctsGap."

